    {
      "id": "p0197-b002",
      "kind": "aside",
      "source": {
        "text": "My theory is that the \"Double Davis\" here is somehow related to the \"Double Davy\" knot, but who knows anymore",
        "raw": "My theory is that the\n\"Double Davis\" here\nis somehow related\nt o th e \" D o u b le D a vy \"\nk n o t, b u t w h o k no w s\nanymore",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
