    {
      "id": "p0197-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "In some cases, two Pyrope monsters will appear in battle at the same time. When this happens, the battle begins with the English message:",
        "raw": "In some cases, two Pyrope monsters will appear in battle at the same time.\nWhen this happens, the battle begins with the English message:",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.08412075,
          0.24246429,
          0.65909431,
          0.27338571
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.08207327,
          0.24175,
          0.70163073,
          0.27445714
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          36,
          37
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "有时两个 Pyrope 会同时出现在战斗中。此时英文版的开场提示是：",
