    {
      "id": "p0197-b005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "From the player's perspective, this line appears to be a reference to something, but that \"something\" is never made clear. Fans have shared multiple theories over the years, but the truth remains a mystery. During this book's production, Toby privately stated that it was something he probably just made up at the time.",
        "raw": "From the player's perspective, this line appears to be a reference to something,\nbut that \"something\" is never made clear. Fans have shared multiple theories\nover the years, but the truth remains a mystery. During this book's production,\nToby privately stated that it was something he probably just made up at the\ntime.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.0850114,
          0.31605,
          0.69290846,
          0.40267143
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.08207327,
          0.31533571,
          0.70163073,
          0.40374286
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          39,
          40,
          41,
          42,
          43
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "在玩家看来，这句话像是在引用什么，但究竟指什么，一直不明。多年来，粉丝提出过各种猜测，真相却仍是谜。本书制作期间，Toby 私下说，这大概只是他当时随手编的。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.08412075,
          0.31428571,
          0.70023844,
          0.58357143
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "line_height": 1.45,
        "font_weight": 450,
        "background": "transparent",
        "text_align": "justify",
        "auto_height": true,
        "limit_bottom": 0.5835714285714285,
        "snap_to_guides": true,
        "resize_anchor": "left",
        "gap_before": 12,
        "flow_after": "p0197-b004"
      },
      "calibration": {
        "bbox": [
          0.08412075,
          0.31428571,
          0.70023844,
          0.58357143
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "leading": 29.0
      },
      "review_issues": [],
      "region_id": "body"
    },
    {
      "id": "p0197-b006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Unfortunately, Toby didn't provide any extra information about this line during the localization process, so the translator was left as puzzled as fans are. So, without any clear information to work from, the translator interpreted \"Double Davis\" as a potential reference to the \"Double Dutch\" jump-rope game that children play, just with added danger. The Japanese line thus became:",
        "raw": "Unfortunately, Toby didn't provide any extra information about this line during\nthe localization process, so the translator was left as puzzled as fans are. So,\nwithout any clear information to work from, the translator interpreted \"Double\nDavis\" as a potential reference to the \"Double Dutch\" jump-rope game that\nchildren play, just with added danger. The Japanese line thus became:",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.08512402,
          0.41763571,
          0.69958325,
          0.50292143
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.08207327,
          0.41692143,
          0.70163073,
          0.50399286
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          44,
          45,
          46,
          47,
          48
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "遗憾的是，本地化时 Toby 没有提供进一步解释，译者也和粉丝一样困惑。没有明确线索可循，译者便把“Double Davis”理解为可能在指儿童玩的“Double Dutch”（交互绳）游戏，只是多了一份危险。日版大意是：",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
